      "id": "claim_7197e0d25e74472286e2d1970c749537",
      "statement": "useWalletLifecycle computes walletReady = accounts !== null || walletCheckTimedOut: the provider's accounts is null while no authorization is resolved and becomes the authorized-accounts array once one is, and a 500ms setTimeout (WALLET_TIMEOUT_MS) re-armed on every accounts change sets walletCheckTimedOut only if accounts is still null at that moment — so a resolved-but-disconnected provider is ready immediately with no timeout.",
