    {
      "id": "claim_44f6eed834404fdb83e8adc609d11796",
      "statement": "Once a valid account address is seen, useWalletLifecycle latches readiness permanently: the effect on account?.address sets walletCheckTimedOut to true (nothing ever resets it), persists the address via setStoredWalletAddress for headless widget access, and clears the pending timeout — so disconnect, which returns accounts to null, never flips walletReady back to false.",
