      "statement": "handleDisconnect reads the stored address before disconnecting, awaits the kit's disconnect, logs an Observe wallet.disconnect event with hadStoredAddress, and only when an address was stored removes it via setStoredWalletAddress(undefined) and calls clearRangeState(currentAddress) — deleting that wallet's alert baseline so a future session cannot transition against stale in-range state.",
